          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A
            %em Henselian ring
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+ring"} local ring
            for which the conclusion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hensel%27s+lemma"} Hensel's lemma
            (classically stated for a
            = succeed ")" do
              %span.newWikiWord
                complete local ring
                %a{:href => "/nlab/new/complete+local+ring"} ?
